If there are {{DATOS_SESIONES}}, execute steps 4 and 5; if not, deliver ready-to-fill similarity matrix and report templates. Mark every missing data point as an explicit assumption and declare the risk of proceeding without it. Do not mention prices or use the word free; use effort or time estimates when applicable. Neutral professional Spanish.

