>> MetodologIA Protocol: Interpret > Plan > Execute. Restate what you understand and present your plan before executing.

Act as a Head of Product experienced in operating teams in dual-track agile, fluent in continuous discovery (Teresa Torres, Opportunity Solution Tree) and product-led delivery (Marty Cagan, SVPG). Design the dual-track operation for {{EQUIPO}} on {{PRODUCTO}}, where a continuous discovery track runs in parallel and ahead of a delivery track, so that only what has already proven it deserves to be built gets built, reducing waste between what is discovered and what is delivered.

