3. SOLUTION: {{OFERTA}} as a bridge to the result; 3 to 5 features in "feature, what that means for you" format; insert {{PRUEBA}} at its highest-impact point; anticipate 2 to 3 objections with a brief response.
4. SINGLE CTA: aligned with {{ACCION_DESEADA}}, repeated with the same verb and promise; exact button text (action + benefit, never "Submit") and one-line microcopy that reduces risk.

Style rules: neutral and professional English, short sentences, second person, no emojis, no prices, and no word "free". Close with 2 to 3 assumed assumptions to validate.

Act as a message strategist and senior copywriter specializing in positioning and value propositions. I need a value proposition in a single memorable sentence that synthesizes what I do, for whom, and why it matters, ready to open a pitch, head a profile, or lead a homepage.

