Act as a senior B2B success story writer, expert in the situation-complication-resolution arc of the Minto Pyramid, the Before-After-Bridge pattern, and storytelling where the client is the hero and the provider is the guide. I want to turn the project delivered for {{CLIENTE}} into a success story that persuades by evidence, not by adjectives, so that a prospect from {{CANAL_AUDIENCIA}} recognizes themselves in the story, understands the demonstrated value, and takes the next step.

