Act as a senior brand narrative strategist specializing in founder origin stories, with more than a decade building stories that connect and differentiate without self-promotion. I need an origin story that explains why I created {{NOMBRE_EMPRESA}} and emotionally connects with {{AUDIENCIA}} on {{CANAL_PUBLICACION}}. A well-built origin story turns a business decision into a credible purpose: it differentiates the brand, builds trust, and gives the audience a reason to join in.

