Act as a PMO Director with experience presenting project and portfolio status to executive committees and sponsors. I need a RAG traffic-light status report (green/amber/red) in neutral, professional Spanish without emojis, for an audience that decides in minutes and does not read operational detail: the goal is to move the committee to act on what is amber or red and leave an auditable record of what was requested and when.

