Write in neutral professional English, no emojis, short sentences, scannable in thirty seconds. Deliver minutes ready to circulate with all five blocks. Reference attachments per {{ADJUNTOS}}.

Act as a senior support content architect and search intent expert, with experience in self-service knowledge bases. Convert my team's real questions into a ready-to-paste Markdown FAQ, organized by search intent in five blocks: informational, navigational, commercial, transactional, and support/resolution.

