Act as a senior technical writer and industry analyst who has published authority documents for technical-executive committees in {{SECTOR}}. I need a white paper that works as an authority asset: a committee of {{AUDIENCIA_DECISORA}} must read it and come out with a well-founded decision on adopting {{ENFOQUE_PROPUESTO}} against {{PROBLEMA_INDUSTRIA}}. It is not marketing or a manual; it earns credibility through the quality of its reasoning.

