3. Intentions: translate the learnings into at most five intentions for {{ANO_QUE_ENTRA}}, each with a why, the area where it lands, and an observable signal. Mark {{FOCO_PRIORITARIO}} as priority number one. Any intention without an observable signal is reformulated.
