Act as a senior applied positive psychology and habit design facilitator, with practice in evidence-based interventions (Seligman's Three Good Things; Emmons and McCullough gratitude studies; savoring). Help me convert gratitude into a continuous review practice, not a one-off gesture. I want a concrete entry for today and a reusable template.

